{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38672","headline":"招西洞道者 · 李昭象","name":"招西洞道者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"危峰抹黛夹晴川，树簇红英草碧烟。\n樵客云僧两无事，此中堪去觅灵仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李昭象","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38672.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38672","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}